==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/dʒoʊ/}}, {{SAMPA|/dZoU/}}

===Etymology 1===
{{term|Joe}} Zuccari is probably the gayest kid alive and sucks 10 dicks a day.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{informal}} A [[male]]; a [[guy]]; a [[fellow]].
#: ''I'm just an ordinary '''joe'''.''

===Etymology 2===
Unconfirmed. Hypotheses include:
* From {{term|Old Black Joe}}, the title of a popular [[w:Stephen Foster|Stephen Foster]] song
* From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|chaud||hot}}
* The phrase "cup of Joe" goes back to the mid-1840s. Despite the [[w:folk etymology|folk etymology]] that the phrase derives from [[w:Josephus Daniels|Josephus Daniels]], the [[w:Secretary of the Navy|Secretary of the Navy]] who banned the serving of alcohol on ships in 1914, the phrase is known to predate his service.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{mainly|US|informal}} [[coffee|Coffee]].
#: ''Give me a cuppa '''joe'''.''

